--- !u!114 &798951190
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 798951188}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ef99e79683bc6a74ebbe44f3a005ae0c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  entries:
  - _text: ' '
    _textColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    _characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _voice: {fileID: 0}
    _time: 1
  - _text: "Wow! C'\xE9tait trop cool! On le refait?"
    _textColor: {r: 0.654902, g: 0.31764707, b: 1, a: 1}
    _characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _voice: {fileID: 0}
    _time: 2
  - _text: "Non. Mes balles \xE9lectriques ont un temps de rechargement."
    _textColor: {r: 1, g: 0.49019608, b: 0, a: 1}
    _characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _voice: {fileID: 0}
    _time: 2
  - _text: Tu ne peux donc les utiliser que toutes les 20 secondes.
    _textColor: {r: 1, g: 0.49019608, b: 0, a: 1}
    _characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _voice: {fileID: 0}
    _time: 2
  - _text: Pfff... Trop nul...
    _textColor: {r: 0.654902, g: 0.31764707, b: 1, a: 1}
    _characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _voice: {fileID: 0}
    _time: 2
  - _text: Par contre tu peux les utiliser sur d'autres choses que les portes.
    _textColor: {r: 1, g: 0.49019608, b: 0, a: 1}
    _characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _voice: {fileID: 0}
    _time: 2
  - _text: Enfin bref, on verra plus tard...
    _textColor: {r: 1, g: 0.49019608, b: 0, a: 1}
    _characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _voice: {fileID: 0}
    _time: 2
  entriesEnglish:
  - _text: ' '
    _textColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    _characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _voice: {fileID: 0}
    _time: 1
  - _text: 'That was cool! Let''s do it again!No. My electric bullets '
    _textColor: {r: 0.654902, g: 0.31764707, b: 1, a: 1}
    _characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _voice: {fileID: 0}
    _time: 2
  - _text: No. My electric bullets need a reloading time.
    _textColor: {r: 1, g: 0.49019608, b: 0, a: 1}
    _characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _voice: {fileID: 0}
    _time: 2
  - _text: So you can only use it every 20 seconds.
    _textColor: {r: 1, g: 0.49019608, b: 0, a: 1}
    _characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _voice: {fileID: 0}
    _time: 2
  - _text: "Ugh\u2026 That sucks\u2026"
    _textColor: {r: 0.654902, g: 0.31764707, b: 1, a: 1}
    _characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _voice: {fileID: 0}
    _time: 2
  - _text: You can use them on things other than doors, though.
    _textColor: {r: 1, g: 0.49019608, b: 0, a: 1}
    _characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _voice: {fileID: 0}
    _time: 2
  - _text: "Anyway, we\u2019ll see about that later\u2026"
    _textColor: {r: 1, g: 0.49019608, b: 0, a: 1}
    _characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _voice: {fileID: 0}
    _time: 2
  _text: {fileID: 1358616519}
  _index: -1
  _imobilisePlayer: 0
  _controller: {fileID: 0}
  _canActivateSomething: 0
  _objectToActivate: {fileID: 0}
