--- !u!114 &1864495511
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1864495509}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f925211df67c05148b6eec314b54d81b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 1864495512}
  _texts:
  - "C'\xE9tait bien tent\xE9..."
  - "Une strat\xE9gie... Audacieuse..."
  - "Je crois que c'\xE9tait volontaire..."
  - Statistiquement impossible de faire pire.
  - "Non mais l\xE0 c'est abus\xE9..."
  - "Tu pensais vraiment que \xE7a allait passer?"
  - Oh non!
  - Mais t'es vraiment nul ma parole!
  - "Je vais arr\xEAter de commenter je pense..."
  - "M\xEAme ma grand-m\xE8re joue mieux que toi."
  _textsEnglish:
  - Well tried...
  - An... ambitious strategy...
  - I think you did it on purpose...
  - Statistically impossible to do worse than that.
  - "Okay, this is ridiculous\u2026"
  - You really thought that was okay?
  - Oh no!
  - You're reaaaaally bad...
  - I think I'll keep my comments to myself now...
  - Even my grandma is better than you!
