    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_otherDialogues.Array.data[1]'
      value: Cet endroit est incroyable!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_otherDialogues.Array.data[2]'
      value: "Il a \xE9t\xE9 construit par une ancienne civilisation qui vivait ici
        avant les humains!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_otherDialogues.Array.data[3]'
      value: "J'aimerais bien savoir ce qui leur est arriv\xE9..."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_otherDialogues.Array.data[4]'
      value: Laisse tomber...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[0]'
      value: ' '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[1]'
      value: LOGBOOK
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[2]'
      value: EXPEDITION NUMBER 12
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[3]'
      value: 'Day 1:'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[4]'
      value: We explored the ruins.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[5]'
      value: No trace of that mura the old man told us about.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[6]'
      value: Maybe he lied to us?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[7]'
      value: I should have know...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[8]'
      value: We'll continue to explore anyway....
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[9]'
      value: 'Day 2:'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[10]'
      value: Anton drowned in one of the cave's rivers.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[11]'
      value: Even with the mecansims we found in the ruins.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[12]'
      value: We found a secret room.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[13]'
      value: And we found a purple star on a pedestal.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[14]'
      value: "We didn\u2019t dare touch it. So many strange things happen around
        here."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[15]'
      value: 'Day 3:'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[16]'
      value: We have been attacked by beetles.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[17]'
      value: That's the first time I see bugs this big!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[18]'
      value: We outrunned them when the bumped on each other.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[19]'
      value: And we rested for the night.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[20]'
      value: 'Day 4:'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[21]'
      value: We found the mura the old man told us about!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[22]'
      value: It was in a secret room, with a purple star too.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[23]'
      value: The mura represents an unknown species.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[24]'
      value: Probably the one who lived in these ruins.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[25]'
      value: 'Day 5: '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[26]'
      value: Strange vases started running oufter us.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[27]'
      value: I guess they were created by the people who lived here.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[28]'
      value: 'Day 6:'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[29]'
      value: When we tried to leave the caves we found another secret room.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[30]'
      value: Another star was in there, and this time, Russell touched it.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[31]'
      value: Nothing happened.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[32]'
      value: 'Day 7:'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[33]'
      value: Already one week.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[34]'
      value: We were surprised by a giant beast.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[35]'
      value: A worm? A snake? I don't really know...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[36]'
      value: Thankfully, the beast did not see us.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[37]'
      value: However, we came back to the last secret room to avoid it.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[38]'
      value: 'Dy 10:'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[39]'
      value: We are still in the same room.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[40]'
      value: The beast won't let us out.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[41]'
      value: If this situation goes on, we will die of hunger.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[42]'
      value: 'Day 18:'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[43]'
      value: It can't goes on anymore.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[44]'
      value: The beast seems to have a weak spot on its tail.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[45]'
      value: We will attack it.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[46]'
      value: 'Day 19:'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[47]'
      value: It worked!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[48]'
      value: The beast ran away when we attacked its weak spot.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[49]'
      value: We can leave this place and go to Kairos!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[50]'
      value: The last planet on our list.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[51]'
      value: I will let this logbook here if anyone needs advises.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[52]'
      value: Good luck!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[53]'
      value: And it's signed with the name "Taylor"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
