      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_otherDialogues.Array.data[1]'
      value: "La Com\xE8te se rapproche de nous."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_otherDialogues.Array.data[2]'
      value: "D'ici quelques temps, on pourra l'observer \xE0 l'oeil nu."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_otherDialogues.Array.data[3]'
      value: "La derni\xE8re fois que c'est arriv\xE9 c'\xE9tait il y a environ 800
        ans."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_otherDialogues.Array.data[4]'
      value: "C'\xE9tait peu apr\xE8s que les humains n'arrivent dans le syst\xE8me
        solaire. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_otherDialogues.Array.data[5]'
      value: "C'est un \xE9v\xE8nement historique!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[0]'
      value: ' '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[1]'
      value: I love to look at the sky
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[2]'
      value: Today, we can see the Comet more clearly than ever before.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[3]'
      value: The Comet?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[4]'
      value: Yes, the Comet that travels in our solar system.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[5]'
      value: Most of the time, it's too far to even see.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[6]'
      value: "But lately, I feel like it\u2019s getting closer."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialoguesEnglish.Array.data[7]'
      value: "Soon, we\u2019ll almost be able to take a picture of it!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _otherTextColors.Array.data[0].a
